            "GET %s HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: %s:%d\r\nUpgrade: websocket\r\nConnection: Upgrade\r\nSec-WebSocket-Key: %s\r\nSec-WebSocket-Version: 13\r\n\r\n",
            path,host,port,key_b64);
